RESORTS INTERNATIONAL AND PLAINTIFFS' COUNSEL REACH AGREEMENT TO SETTLE OCT. 2017 LITIGATION", 'text': "MGM RESORTS INTERNATIONAL AND PLAINTIFFS' COUNSEL REACH AGREEMENT TO SETTLE 1 OCTOBER LITIGATION.MGM RESORTS INTERNATIONAL - TOTAL SETTLEMENT AMOUNT IS EXPECTED TO BE BETWEEN $735 MILLION AND $800 MILLION.MGM RESORTS INTERNATIONAL - SETTLEMENT FUND WILL BE FUNDED BY MGM RESORTS' INSURERS WITH A MINIMUM OF $735 MILLION.MGM RESORTS INTERNATIONAL - ENTIRE PROCESS IS EXPECTED TO BE COMPLETED BY LATE 2020.MGM RESORTS INTERNATIONAL - CO, COUNSEL REPRESENTING PLAINTIFFS IN LITIGATION INVOLVING OCTOBER 1, 2017 SHOOTING REACHED SETTLEMENT AGREEMENT.MGM RESORTS INTERNATIONAL - UNDER SETTLEMENT AGREEMENT, PARTIES WILL DISMISS AND RELEASE ALL PENDING LITIGATION.MGM RESORTS INTERNATIONAL - PROPOSED SETTLEMENT IS NOT AN ADMISSION OF LIABILITY BY MGM RESORTS."}{'symbol': 'MRNA', 'date': '2019-10-03 22:30:00', 'title': 'CUREVAC AG, 7TH INTERNATIONAL MRNA HEALTH CONFERENCE 2019, NOV 11, 2019 THROUGH NOV 12, 2019', 'text': 'CUREVAC AG, 7TH INTERNATIONAL MRNA HEALTH CONFERENCE 2019, NOV 11, 2019 THROUGH NOV 12, 2019. VENUE: HILTON HOTEL, BERLIN, BERLIN, GERMANY.'}{'symbol': 'NFLX', 'date': '2019-10-03 22:30:00', 'title': 'NETFLIX, INC. PRESENTS AT GARTNER IT SYMPOSIUM/XPO - GOLD COAST, OCT-30-2019 05:00 PM', 'text': 'NETFLIX, INC. PRESENTS AT GARTNER IT SYMPOSIUM/XPO - GOLD COAST, OCT-30-2019 05:00 PM. VENUE: GOLD COAST CONVENTION AND EXHIBITION CENTRE, CNR GOLD COAST HIGHWAY & TE PETERS DRIVE, BROADBEACH, GOLD COAST, QUEENSLAND, AUSTRALIA. SPEAKERS: MARC RANDOLPH, CO-FOUNDER EXECUTIVE MENTOR AND ANGEL INVESTOR.'}{'symbol': 'NWL', 'date': '2019-10-03 22:30:00', 'title': 'NEWELL BRANDS INC. AND JARDEN RECEIVABLES, LLC ENTER INTO AN AMENDED AND RESTATED LOAN AND SERVICING AGREEMENT', 'text': 'ON OCTOBER 2, 2019, NEWELL BRANDS INC. AND JARDEN RECEIVABLES, LLC ENTERED INTO AN AMENDED AND RESTATED LOAN AND SERVICING AGREEMENT AMONG JARDEN RECEIVABLES, AS BORROWER, THE COMPANY, AS SERVICER, THE CONDUIT LENDERS, THE COMMITTED LENDERS AND THE MANAGING AGENTS NAMED THEREIN, PNC BANK, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION AND ROYAL BANK OF CANADA, EACH AS AN ISSUING LENDER, PNC BANK, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION, AS ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT, AND PNC CAPITAL MARKETS LLC, AS STRUCTURING AGENT (THE “AMENDED AND RESTATED LOAN AND SERVICING AGREEMENT”). THE AMENDED AND RESTATED LOAN AND SERVICING AGREEMENT REPLACES THE COMPANY’S EXISTING LOAN AND SERVICING AGREEMENT THAT WOULD HAVE EXPIRED ON OCTOBER 3, 2019 AND REDUCES THE ACCOUNTS RECEIVABLE FACILITY LIMIT TO $600 MILLION ($500 MILLION DURING THE SEASONAL PERIOD, AS DEFINED IN THE AMENDED AND RESTATED LOAN AND SERVICING AGREEMENT).'}{'symbol': 'NKE', 'date': '2019-10-03 07:30:00', 'title': 'GROUPAMA IMMOBILIER SELLS CHAMPS ELYSEES SITE IN DEAL WORTH 613 MLN EUROS', 'text': 'SAYS IT HAS AGREED TO SELL SITE AT NUMBER 79 CHAMPS ELYSEES (FUTURE NIKE SITE) TO NORGES IN DEAL WORTH 613 MILLION EUROS.'}{'symbol': 'NOC', 'date': '2019-10-03 22:30:00', 'title': 'NORTHROP GRUMMAN CORPORATION APPOINTS PHYLLIS SCHNECK AS VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF INFORMATION SECURITY OFFICER, EFFECTIVE OCT. 14, 2019', 'text': "NORTHROP GRUMMAN CORPORATION HAS APPOINTED PHYLLIS SCHNECK VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF INFORMATION SECURITY OFFICER, EFFECTIVE OCT. 14, 2019. SCHNECK WILL REPORT TO SHAWN PURVIS, CORPORATE VICE PRESIDENT AND PRESIDENT, NORTHROP GRUMMAN ENTERPRISE SERVICES. IN THIS ROLE, SCHNECK WILL OVERSEE NORTHROP GRUMMAN'S GLOBAL CYBERSECURITY STRATEGY AND POLICIES, AND WILL BE RESPONSIBLE THE SECURITY OF THE COMPANY'S PRODUCTS, SERVICES AND INFRASTRUCTURES. MOST RECENTLY, SCHNECK LED THE CYBERSECURITY PRACTICE AT PROMONTORY, AN IBM COMPANY. PREVIOUSLY, SHE SERVED AS THE DEPUTY UNDERSECRETARY FOR CYBERSECURITY AND COMMUNICATIONS FOR THE DEPARTMENT OF HOMELAND SECURITY, WHERE SHE LED RESPONSES TO CYBERSECURITY THREATS AGAINST CORPORATIONS, CIVILIANS AND THE GOVERNMENT. DURING THIS TIME, SHE LED THE DEFENSIVE CYBERSECURITY OPERATIONAL MISSION TO MITIGATE AND RESPOND TO CYBER THREATS ACROSS THE FEDERAL CIVILIAN GOVERNMENT AND PRIVATE SECTOR."}{'symbol': 'NCLH', 'date': '2019-10-03 11:30:00', 'title': 'NORWEGIAN CRUISE LINE HOLDINGS ANNOUNCES APPOINTMENT OF HARRY SOMME AS CEO', 'text': 'NORWEGIAN CRUISE LINE HOLDINGS ANNOUNCES ORGANIZATIONAL CHANGES AT THE NORWEGIAN CRUISE LINE BRAND.NORWEGIAN CRUISE LINE HOLDINGS LTD - ANDY STUART TO STEP DOWN AS PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER OF NORWEGIAN CRUISE LINE FOLLOWING LAUNCH OF NORWEGIAN ENCORE.NORWEGIAN CRUISE LINE - APPOINTMENT OF HARRY SOMME AS CEO.NORWEGIAN CRUISE LINE - STUART WILL STEP DOWN ON DEC 31.NORWEGIAN CRUISE LINE - STUART WILL REMAIN WITH CO AS SENIOR ADVISOR THROUGH MARCH 31, 2020.'}{'symbol': 'PEP', 'date': '2019-10-03 08:30:00', 'title': 'PEPSICO QTRLY EPS $1.49', 'text': 'QTRLY EARNINGS PER SHARE $1.49; QTRLY CORE EARNINGS PER SHARE $1.56; QTRLY NET REVENUE $17.19 BILLION VERSUS $16.49 BILLION.ORGANIC REVENUE GROWTH WAS 4.3% IN QUARTER.SEES FOREIGN EXCHANGE TRANSLATION TO HAVE 2 PERCENTAGE POINT HEADWIND ON FY REPORTED NET REVENUE & EPS.QTRLY PEPSICO BEVERAGES NORTH AMERICA NET REVENUE $5.64 BILLION VERSUS $5.46 BILLION.NOW EXPECTS TO MEET OR EXCEED FULL-YEAR ORGANIC REVENUE GROWTH TARGET OF 4 PERCENT.REAFFIRMING FY GUIDANCE OF CORE CONSTANT CURRENCY EPS, CASH FROM OPERATING ACTIVITIES, FCF ,TOTAL CASH RETURNS TO SHAREHOLDERS.Q3 EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $1.50, REVENUE VIEW $16.93 BILLION -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.FY2019 EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $5.52 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.'}{'symbol': 'PFE', 'date': '2019-10-03 22:30:00', 'title': 'PFIZER INC. PRESENTS AT CREDIT SUISSE 28TH ANNUAL HEALTHCARE CONFERENCE, NOV-12-2019', 'text': 'PFIZER INC. PRESENTS AT CREDIT SUISSE 28TH ANNUAL HEALTHCARE CONFERENCE, NOV-12-2019 . VENUE: THE PHOENICIAN, 6000 EAST CAMELBACK ROAD, SCOTTSDALE, ARIZONA, UNITED STATES. SPEAKERS: RYAN CROWE, SR. DIRECTOR IR.'}{'symbol': 'PSX', 'date': '2019-10-03 22:30:00', 'title': 'PHILLIPS 66 DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND, PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 2, 201